  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There are a few places in the fcrepo-camel-toolbox where components rely on JMS headers such as org.fcrepo.jms.baseUrl or org.fcrepo.jms.identifier. The code should be refactored so that a non-JMS-based message broker could be used.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This particularly affects the serialization tool and the ldpath tool, but some other components will need minor adjustments, too.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
